# Nagumo travelling front: a heteroclinic orbit from u=1 to u=0 with speed c
# u'' + c u' + u(1-u)(u-a) = 0. Bifurcation view (parameter c): under Homoclinic and heteroclinic orbits choose
# From = the saddle at u=1 and To = the saddle at u=0 and press Find; then Follow HET1 in a. The exact speed is c = (1-2a)/sqrt(2).
u'=v
v'=-c*v-u*(1-u)*(u-a)
par c=0.3,a=0.25
init u=0.9,v=0
#@range c 0.05 0.9
#@range a 0.05 0.45
@ total=40,dt=0.05,xp=u,yp=v,xlo=-0.3,xhi=1.3,ylo=-0.5,yhi=0.5
done
